   "text": "The ferry left Anacortes a little after seven, and by the time it cleared the harbor the fog had already begun to lift. Maria stood at the rail with her coffee going cold, watching the islands come up out of the grey one at a time. She had made this crossing a hundred times, but never once, she realized, had she actually looked.",
