   "text": "\"Honestly?\" she said. \"I don't think the problem is the software. It's that nobody reads the manual.\" He laughed, but she wasn't joking. Here's the thing: when a tool is hard to use, we blame ourselves first, then the tool, and only much later the people who decided it should work that way. Why is that?",
